---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/legal-pages.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Siryus Hub"
  description="How siryushub.com uses cookies and similar technologies."
  noIndex={true}
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

    <h2>What are cookies</h2>
    <p>Small files stored on your browser that help websites remember your preferences.</p>

    <h2>What we use</h2>
    <p>
      We use a cookie to remember your theme preference (dark or light mode). This is a functional cookie and is not used for tracking or advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>Third party cookies</h2>
    <p>
      If we embed content from YouTube or Instagram, those platforms may set their own cookies. We do not control those.
    </p>

    <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
    <p>
      You can clear cookies in your browser settings at any time. Your theme preference will reset to default if you do.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about our cookie use: management@siryushub.com</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
